						<p class="pDate">Thursday, February 13, 2003</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Battle Forged Recruiting 
						</p>
						<p class=pText>
						Battle Forged, a small guild on Solusek Ro, is recruiting new members.  Please see our website www.battle-forged.com for our rules and member requirements.<BR><BR>We are looking for players who are interested in joining together to hunt and have fun.  We're not about uber encounters or phat lewtz.  We're about the most precious loot out there, Friendship.
						<br>
						 - Severine<BR><BR>
						</p>
						<p class="sHeader">Comments</p>
						
							<p class="pDate">Saturday, February 15, 2003</p>
							
							<p class="pTitle">For clarification 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							I mean the two winners below me. My bad.
							<br>
							 - P.O.P.<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Hmm 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							You guys have a lot of friends huh? Hilarious.
							<br>
							 - P.O.P.<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">ROFL 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							The "friendship" argument is old and used, please spare me with this crap.<BR>"we are a small guild aimed at guiding newbs trought the lower game in orer to make them join bigger guils in the future, really that's all we can do" sounds more right.
							<br>
							 - sham<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">all about the loot 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							awww thats cute........friendship....its all about the loot!
							<br>
							 - kreo<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Obviously... 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							You haven't read our requirements for new members.  We don't allow anyone under level 36 to join as a new member as most of our players are in their upper 50s & 60s.  We play casually & don't see spending all our time time sinking keys or working on epics
							<br>
							 - Severine<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Idiots 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							No, she meant friendship, and not loot.  She meant not sitting in our parent's basements for 23 hours a day, pounding down cheese puffs and mountain dew with our acne ridden faces glued to the Everquest monitor sweating bullets over what the Mobs in Mitha
							<br>
							 - Winterbane Shadowstorm<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Fearthen 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							isnt that sweet :-P
							<br>
							 - dozier<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
